app ui-space-station-board "1.0.0"
"SpaceStationBoard — sci-fi isometric crew board: crew units select/move across a station grid (no combat); composes the std multi-unit crew frame with a hand-authored isometric svg asset theme."
;; @capabilities "isometric crew unit selection, station grid movement, multi-unit crew management, non-combat sci-fi sim"

;; ============================================================================
;; PERSONA + USER STORIES
;;
;; Read these before changing anything here, and walk them end to end after.
;; One persona: the PLAYER, directing a three-person station crew on a 7x7
;; isometric deck. Status verified 2026-07-31 through the almadar-tools
;; play_transition probes (guard truth, real evaluator) on the std-crew-board-2d
;; frame this organism composes, AND through the Gate-4 live playthrough the
;; same day: standalone playground (@almadar-io/playground-runtime + real JS
;; runtime, events via the __orbitalVerification bridge, evidence via canvas
;; drawables + HUD DOM + bus eventLog; report + per-story screenshots in
;; docs/runtime-verification-screenshots/gate4-ui-space-station-board/).
;; No claim below is untested hearsay.
;;
;; THE GENRE (what a station-crew-sim player expects): a calm, non-combat
;; sandbox. You run a small crew aboard a space station — there are no
;; enemies, no turns, no win/lose clock. The pleasure is directing people:
;; pick a crew member, see where they can walk (the deck is the constraint —
;; walls ring the station, console blocks are furniture you path around),
;; send them there, and watch the station live. A round looks like: click a
;; crew member -> green reachable floor cells light up (range 2, manhattan)
;; -> click a lit cell -> the crew member WALKS there (walk frames play)
;; -> the board settles back to idle, ready for the next order. Walls and
;; consoles are impassable; crew cannot stack on one cell. The HUD is station
;; chrome: Crew count, Oxygen, current Status. (Oxygen is display-only — the
;; organism never depletes it; that sim layer does not exist yet.)
;; ============================================================================
;;
;; PLAYER — "I direct my crew around the station deck."
;;
;;   1. I open the board and see the whole station deck framed on screen —
;;      a walled 7x7 isometric grid, floor inside, four console blocks, my
;;      three crew standing on the deck, and the HUD showing Crew/Oxygen/
;;      Status with a Cancel button and the minimap on.
;;        WORKS (Gate-4 live playthrough 2026-07-31). Boot paints 49 full-cell
;;        isometric terrain cubes (wall ring impassable, floor interior,
;;        console blocks at (1,2),(5,2),(1,4),(5,4) — drawable census 24 wall /
;;        21 floor / 4 console), 3 crew units (Commander (2,3), Engineer (4,3),
;;        Technician (3,5)), 4 console features ground-anchored ON their cells,
;;        HUD reads Crew 3 / Oxygen 100 / Status idle with a Cancel button; all
;;        13 CDN sprite assets load (assetStatus all "loaded", zero failed
;;        requests, zero console errors). Sprite PAINTING confirmed visually on
;;        the story-1 screenshot (crew/feature/terrain SVGs on canvas, not the
;;        shape underlay). CAVEAT: the minimap chrome renders (bordered 150x100
;;        canvas, showMinimap on) but paints no tile dots in the playground's
;;        pre-bundled @almadar/ui — pixel probe: 1 distinct color; substrate
;;        issue in the bundled Canvas2D/MiniMap, not this organism.
;;   2. Every crew member is a visible sprite with a name label and a health
;;      bar I can read at a glance — and it breathes.
;;        WORKS (Gate-4 live playthrough 2026-07-31). Each unit paints
;;        units/crew.svg url-rewritten to the .idle-<0..3> frames (4-frame
;;        breathing squash/stretch anchored at the feet, cycled by the
;;        AnimClock tick), anchor "ground": a 20s drawable probe watched all
;;        three units cycle through ALL FOUR crew.idle-<0..3>.svg frames.
;;        Name labels (Commander/Engineer/Technician draw-text) and the black
;;        backing + green health fraction (6 bar shapes) confirmed in the
;;        draw list and on the story-2 screenshot. A hidden warm-up layer
;;        (27 zero-opacity sprites) preloads every frame so swaps never pop.
;;   3. I click a crew member and the cells they can reach light up green.
;;        WORKS (Gate-4 live playthrough 2026-07-31). UNIT_CLICK u1 through
;;        the live runtime flips the HUD badge to "movement" and lights
;;        EXACTLY the 8-cell manhattan-2 diamond of passable floor minus
;;        occupied cells — drawable census matched the computed set
;;        {(2,1),(2,2),(3,2),(1,3),(3,3),(2,4),(3,4),(2,5)} cell-for-cell;
;;        walls and consoles never light up (guard + highlight filter both
;;        check passable). Re-clicking the selected unit deselects instead
;;        (toggle arm, verified in story 6). Story-3 screenshot shows the
;;        green diamond + cyan selection ring + MOVEMENT badge. (Earlier
;;        guard truth via play_transition on 2026-07-31 also stands; the
;;        headless MCP play server still does not deliver UI events to
;;        interaction traits — TOOLS-ORBITAL-PLAY-UNIT-CLICK-NO-TRANSITION —
;;        so the bridge-driven playground is the end-to-end evidence.)
;;   4. I click a lit cell and the crew member walks there.
;;        WORKS (Gate-4 live playthrough 2026-07-31). TILE_CLICK (3,3) with
;;        u1 selected emitted MOVE {u1,3,3} (eventLog: UI:MOVE + the
;;        namespaced UI:SpaceStationBoardOrbital.Crew.MOVE), the hero-nav
;;        authority applied it (UI:HERO_STEPPED {u1,3,3,movesLeft:999998}),
;;        the Commander's draw position moved (2,3)->(3,3), crew.walk-0.svg
;;        frames painted during the walk window, then selection/validMoves
;;        cleared and the badge returned to "idle" (story-4 screenshot).
;;   5. I click a wall, a console, an occupied cell, or a cell beyond reach
;;      and nothing happens — the order is rejected, not silently eaten.
;;        WORKS (Gate-4 live playthrough 2026-07-31). With u1 selected, all
;;        four illegal targets — wall (0,0), console (1,2), occupied (4,3),
;;        out-of-range floor (5,5) — were clicked through the live runtime;
;;        each was held under a 10s watch (a legal move round-trips in ~7s
;;        on this rig): zero MOVE emissions, selection/green cells retained,
;;        unit position unchanged. Rejected, not silently eaten. (The wave-3
;;        fix added the missing passable clause to guard + highlight filter;
;;        earlier play_transition guard probes agree.)
;;   6. I change my mind mid-order and back out cleanly.
;;        WORKS (Gate-4 live playthrough 2026-07-31). Both escape hatches
;;        verified live: with u2 selected (green diamond lit, badge
;;        "movement"), clicking the DOM Cancel button cleared selection +
;;        green cells and returned the badge to "idle" (~1.1s); and
;;        re-clicking the selected unit toggled it off the same way (~2.4s).
;;        Story-6 screenshots bracket both.
;;   7. I direct the whole crew, one order at a time — every member moves
;;      independently.
;;        WORKS (Gate-4 live playthrough 2026-07-31). Back-to-back orders on
;;        different members: u1 walked (3,3)->(1,3), then u2 selected and
;;        walked (4,3)->(4,1) on the very next order — two MOVE/HERO_STEPPED
;;        pairs in the eventLog (movesLeft 999997 then 999996 — effectively
;;        unlimited budget), Technician untouched at (3,5). No per-turn
;;        activation locks; occupied cells stay un-orderable (story 5's
;;        occupied probe). Story-7 screenshot shows both new positions.
;;   8. The HUD reads like station chrome: crew count, oxygen, live status.
;;        WORKS (Gate-4 live playthrough 2026-07-31). After the full move
;;        sequence the HUD still reads Crew 3 / Oxygen 100 (station icons
;;        rendered), and the Status badge flipped idle -> movement on the
;;        u3 selection and back to idle on cancel (story-8 screenshot caught
;;        the MOVEMENT badge mid-order). TRUTH: Oxygen and Crew are
;;        display-only (config seeds them at INIT; no atom writes them
;;        after) — documented on the molecule config, not a bug.
;;
;; ASSET INVENTORY (hand-authored svg, almadar-kflow-assets.web.app
;; /shared/ui-space-station-board/svg/isometric/, generated by
;; tools/asset-workflow svg-generator from the sibling .md descriptions)
;;
;;   Terrain   terrain/{wall,floor,console}.svg — full-cell isometric cubes
;;             (top + left + right faces) that tessellate exactly with the
;;             projector's cellPath; drawn at width/height 1, anchor center.
;;   Units     units/crew.svg + animation frames .{idle-0..3, walk-0..1,
;;             attack-0, hit-0, death-0}.svg (the full actor contract, though
;;             this non-combat board only ever plays idle/walk); the frame
;;             swaps url-rewrites name.svg -> name.<anim>-<i>.svg.
;;             crew: u1 Commander (2,3)  u2 Engineer (4,3)  u3 Technician (3,5)
;;   Features  features/console.svg at (1,2),(5,2),(1,4),(5,4) — drawn from
;;             config.features anchored "ground" at 1x1 so they sit ON their
;;             cells (the draw-sprite default anchor is "top-left", which
;;             floated them off the board corner before the anchor was
;;             explicit in the frame molecule).
;;   UI chrome ui/panel-frame.svg = game-shell background + HUD panel;
;;             ui/{icon-crew,icon-oxygen,icon-cancel}.svg = HUD stat/button
;;             icons.
;; ============================================================================

orbital SpaceStationBoardOrbital {
  uses Frame from "std/behaviors/std-crew-board-2d"

  type Asset = {
    url : asset
    atlas : asset
    sprite : string
    role : string
    category : string
    animations : [string]
    style : string
    dimension : string
    aspect : string
    name : string
    thumbnailUrl : string
  }
  type Unit = {
    id : string!
    position : { x : number!  y : number! }
    x : number
    y : number
    z : number
    team : string
    health : number
    maxHealth : number
    unitType : string
    name : string
    modelUrl : Asset
  }
  type Tile = {
    id : string
    x : number!
    y : number!
    z : number
    terrain : string
    passable : boolean
    terrainSprite : Asset
  }
  type Fx = {
    id : string!
    type : string!
    x : number!
    z : number
    y : number
    message : string
    ttl : number!
  }
  type ValidMove = { x : number!  z : number! }
  type Feature = {
    id : string
    x : number!
    y : number!
    z : number
    type : string
    assetUrl : Asset
    color : string
    elevation : number
  }
  type AssetManifest = {
    terrains : Map string Asset
    units : Map string Asset
    features : Map string Asset
    effects : Map string Asset
  }

  entity GameState [runtime, shared] {
    id : string!
    units : [Unit] = []
    tiles : [Tile] = []
    movesLeft : number = 0
    fx : [Fx] = []
    selectedUnitId : string = ""
    validMoves : [ValidMove] = []
    phase : string = "idle"
    oxygen : number = 100
    crewCount : number = 3
  }

  trait CrewAuthority = Frame.traits.CrewAuthority -> GameState {
    config {
      running: true
      gridWidth: 7
      gridHeight: 7
      moveBudget: 999999
      units: [
        { id: "u1", position: { x: 2, y: 3 }, x: 2, y: 3, z: 0, team: "player", health: 10, maxHealth: 10, unitType: "crew", name: "Commander", modelUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-space-station-board/svg/isometric/units/crew.svg", role: "npc", category: "crew", animations: ["idle","walk","attack","hit","death"], style: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "crew", thumbnailUrl: "" } },
        { id: "u2", position: { x: 4, y: 3 }, x: 4, y: 3, z: 0, team: "player", health: 10, maxHealth: 10, unitType: "crew", name: "Engineer", modelUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-space-station-board/svg/isometric/units/crew.svg", role: "npc", category: "crew", animations: ["idle","walk","attack","hit","death"], style: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "crew", thumbnailUrl: "" } },
        { id: "u3", position: { x: 3, y: 5 }, x: 3, y: 5, z: 0, team: "player", health: 10, maxHealth: 10, unitType: "crew", name: "Technician", modelUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-space-station-board/svg/isometric/units/crew.svg", role: "npc", category: "crew", animations: ["idle","walk","attack","hit","death"], style: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "crew", thumbnailUrl: "" } }
      ]
      tiles: [
        { id: "t-0-0", x: 0, y: 0, terrain: "wall", passable: false },
        { id: "t-1-0", x: 1, y: 0, terrain: "wall", passable: false },
        { id: "t-2-0", x: 2, y: 0, terrain: "wall", passable: false },
        { id: "t-3-0", x: 3, y: 0, terrain: "wall", passable: false },
        { id: "t-4-0", x: 4, y: 0, terrain: "wall", passable: false },
        { id: "t-5-0", x: 5, y: 0, terrain: "wall", passable: false },
        { id: "t-6-0", x: 6, y: 0, terrain: "wall", passable: false },
        { id: "t-0-1", x: 0, y: 1, terrain: "wall", passable: false },
        { id: "t-1-1", x: 1, y: 1, terrain: "floor", passable: true },
        { id: "t-2-1", x: 2, y: 1, terrain: "floor", passable: true },
        { id: "t-3-1", x: 3, y: 1, terrain: "floor", passable: true },
        { id: "t-4-1", x: 4, y: 1, terrain: "floor", passable: true },
        { id: "t-5-1", x: 5, y: 1, terrain: "floor", passable: true },
        { id: "t-6-1", x: 6, y: 1, terrain: "wall", passable: false },
        { id: "t-0-2", x: 0, y: 2, terrain: "wall", passable: false },
        { id: "t-1-2", x: 1, y: 2, terrain: "console", passable: false },
        { id: "t-2-2", x: 2, y: 2, terrain: "floor", passable: true },
        { id: "t-3-2", x: 3, y: 2, terrain: "floor", passable: true },
        { id: "t-4-2", x: 4, y: 2, terrain: "floor", passable: true },
        { id: "t-5-2", x: 5, y: 2, terrain: "console", passable: false },
        { id: "t-6-2", x: 6, y: 2, terrain: "wall", passable: false },
        { id: "t-0-3", x: 0, y: 3, terrain: "wall", passable: false },
        { id: "t-1-3", x: 1, y: 3, terrain: "floor", passable: true },
        { id: "t-2-3", x: 2, y: 3, terrain: "floor", passable: true },
        { id: "t-3-3", x: 3, y: 3, terrain: "floor", passable: true },
        { id: "t-4-3", x: 4, y: 3, terrain: "floor", passable: true },
        { id: "t-5-3", x: 5, y: 3, terrain: "floor", passable: true },
        { id: "t-6-3", x: 6, y: 3, terrain: "wall", passable: false },
        { id: "t-0-4", x: 0, y: 4, terrain: "wall", passable: false },
        { id: "t-1-4", x: 1, y: 4, terrain: "console", passable: false },
        { id: "t-2-4", x: 2, y: 4, terrain: "floor", passable: true },
        { id: "t-3-4", x: 3, y: 4, terrain: "floor", passable: true },
        { id: "t-4-4", x: 4, y: 4, terrain: "floor", passable: true },
        { id: "t-5-4", x: 5, y: 4, terrain: "console", passable: false },
        { id: "t-6-4", x: 6, y: 4, terrain: "wall", passable: false },
        { id: "t-0-5", x: 0, y: 5, terrain: "wall", passable: false },
        { id: "t-1-5", x: 1, y: 5, terrain: "floor", passable: true },
        { id: "t-2-5", x: 2, y: 5, terrain: "floor", passable: true },
        { id: "t-3-5", x: 3, y: 5, terrain: "floor", passable: true },
        { id: "t-4-5", x: 4, y: 5, terrain: "floor", passable: true },
        { id: "t-5-5", x: 5, y: 5, terrain: "floor", passable: true },
        { id: "t-6-5", x: 6, y: 5, terrain: "wall", passable: false },
        { id: "t-0-6", x: 0, y: 6, terrain: "wall", passable: false },
        { id: "t-1-6", x: 1, y: 6, terrain: "wall", passable: false },
        { id: "t-2-6", x: 2, y: 6, terrain: "wall", passable: false },
        { id: "t-3-6", x: 3, y: 6, terrain: "wall", passable: false },
        { id: "t-4-6", x: 4, y: 6, terrain: "wall", passable: false },
        { id: "t-5-6", x: 5, y: 6, terrain: "wall", passable: false },
        { id: "t-6-6", x: 6, y: 6, terrain: "wall", passable: false }
      ]
    }
  }

  trait FxDecay = Frame.traits.FxDecay -> GameState {
    config { running: true }
  }

  trait Crew = Frame.traits.CrewIntent -> GameState {
    config {
      gridWidth: 7
      gridHeight: 7
      movementRange: 2
      oxygen: 100
      crewCount: 3
      features: [
        { id: "f1", x: 1, y: 2, type: "console", assetUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-space-station-board/svg/isometric/features/console.svg", role: "decoration", category: "console", animations: ["static"], style: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "console", thumbnailUrl: "" } },
        { id: "f2", x: 5, y: 2, type: "console", assetUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-space-station-board/svg/isometric/features/console.svg", role: "decoration", category: "console", animations: ["static"], style: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "console", thumbnailUrl: "" } },
        { id: "f3", x: 1, y: 4, type: "console", assetUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-space-station-board/svg/isometric/features/console.svg", role: "decoration", category: "console", animations: ["static"], style: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "console", thumbnailUrl: "" } },
        { id: "f4", x: 5, y: 4, type: "console", assetUrl: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-space-station-board/svg/isometric/features/console.svg", role: "decoration", category: "console", animations: ["static"], style: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "console", thumbnailUrl: "" } }
      ]
      assetManifest: {
        terrains: {
          wall: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-space-station-board/svg/isometric/terrain/wall.svg", role: "tile", category: "wall", animations: ["static"], style: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "wall", thumbnailUrl: "" },
          floor: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-space-station-board/svg/isometric/terrain/floor.svg", role: "tile", category: "floor", animations: ["static"], style: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "floor", thumbnailUrl: "" },
          console: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-space-station-board/svg/isometric/terrain/console.svg", role: "tile", category: "console", animations: ["static"], style: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "console", thumbnailUrl: "" }
        }
        units: {
          crew: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-space-station-board/svg/isometric/units/crew.svg", role: "npc", category: "crew", animations: ["idle","walk","attack","hit","death"], style: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "crew", thumbnailUrl: "" }
        }
        features: {
          console: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-space-station-board/svg/isometric/features/console.svg", role: "decoration", category: "console", animations: ["static"], style: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "console", thumbnailUrl: "" }
        }
        effects: {}
      }
      projection: "isometric"
      showMinimap: true
      scale: 0.45
      backgroundAsset: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-space-station-board/svg/isometric/ui/panel-frame.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "panel-frame", thumbnailUrl: "" }
      hudBackgroundAsset: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-space-station-board/svg/isometric/ui/panel-frame.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "panel-frame", thumbnailUrl: "" }
      crewIcon: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-space-station-board/svg/isometric/ui/icon-crew.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "icon-crew", thumbnailUrl: "" }
      oxygenIcon: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-space-station-board/svg/isometric/ui/icon-oxygen.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "icon-oxygen", thumbnailUrl: "" }
      cancelIcon: { url: "https://almadar-kflow-assets.web.app/shared/ui-space-station-board/svg/isometric/ui/icon-cancel.svg", role: "ui", category: "ui", animations: [], style: "", dimension: "2d", aspect: "1:1", name: "icon-cancel", thumbnailUrl: "" }
    }
  }

  trait AnimClock = Frame.traits.AnimClock -> GameState {
    config { frames: [] }
  }

  page "/space-station-board" as SpaceStationBoardPage -> CrewAuthority, FxDecay, Crew, AnimClock
}
